LICENSE PLACEHOLDER — NOT A GRANT OF RIGHTS

The license for this distribution is a short source-available grant
(personal/internal use, no redistribution) whose text is a legal act that only
the licensor can perform. That text has not been drafted yet.

Until the licensor replaces this file with the actual grant, no rights are
granted: all rights reserved. This placeholder exists so the distribution's
LICENSE slot is visibly reserved (plan nexus-distribution-packaging, decision 4)
rather than silently absent.
